      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "team_0050_select_04",
      "hash64": "72B56C1AFFE63146",
      "text": "不差",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_10",
      "hash64": "B1BDF639D0C31F67",
      "text": "……哦～[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_11",
      "hash64": "B1BDF539D0C31DB4",
      "text": "聽說天星隊也不是\\n壞到骨子裡的不良分子。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_12",
      "hash64": "B1BDF839D0C322CD",
      "text": "大多數的成員是以前被霸凌，\\n或者只是不擅長和人往來而已……[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_13",
      "hash64": "B1BDF739D0C3211A",
      "text": "那些人集結起來，\\n組成了天星隊。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_14",
      "hash64": "B1BDF239D0C3189B",
      "text": "目的是為了戰勝只靠單獨的力量\\n所無法對抗的霸凌……[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_15",
      "hash64": "B1BDF139D0C316E8",
      "text": "啊，這些是人家駭進學生們的\\n社群帳號之後掌握到的情報。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_16",
      "hash64": "B1BDF439D0C31C01",
      "text": "據說還有個號召了５名老大，\\n創建天星隊的真正幕後黑手……[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_17",
      "hash64": "B1BDF339D0C31A4E",
      "text": "人家說太多話了。\\n喉嚨好痛……[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_18",
      "hash64": "B1BDEE39D0C311CF",
      "text": "剩下的天星隊基地，\\n呃……[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳繼續加油吧。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
